<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Move!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">1nonly</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">Savage Ga$p</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v3">Ciscaux</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Move!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4wVp0fs0k24q05f0CP6PVS</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.286" end="00:01.786">[Intro: 1nonly]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.348" end="00:02.848">Uh, uh, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.719" end="00:04.219" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hit that shit , mother****er)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.053" end="00:05.656" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Uh, uh (It's the last layer I can't do)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.656" end="00:07.526" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yeah, ayy, yeah, ayy (Do that shit), ayy, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.526" end="00:09.026">[Chorus: 1nonly, Ciscaux]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.057" end="00:09.951">I got a bad b***h, so I told her, "What's up?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.951" end="00:12.110">You know who it is when I step in the club</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.110" end="00:14.038">Like, Oh shit, b***h, why you tryna ****?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.038" end="00:16.197">Break it down and bring that shit back up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.197" end="00:18.323">Like, "Oh shit , get out the way"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.323" end="00:20.469">I be makin' moves, b***h, I be makin' plays</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.469" end="00:22.351">I'm smooth, b***h, money on the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.351" end="00:24.516">I don't give a **** 'cause I be gettin' pape'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.516" end="00:26.669">Like, Oh shit, get out the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.669" end="00:28.842">I be makin' moves, b***h, I be makin' plays</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.842" end="00:30.723">I'm smooth, b***h, money on the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.723" end="00:32.857" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't give a **** 'cause I be gettin' pape' (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.857" end="00:34.357">Like, oh—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.649" end="00:35.149">[Verse 1: Ciscaux]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.914" end="00:35.414" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I got money on the way like UPS (UPS)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.266" end="00:36.888">You tried to take it, I'ma count down two-three texts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.888" end="00:39.034" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I got a baddie out in Texas, go to UT Tech (UT Tech)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.034" end="00:41.161" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I told her, "Baby, get down to give me UC neck" (Uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.161" end="00:43.584" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Make a b***h ride like a scooter (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.584" end="00:45.444" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That boy a liar, he say he a shooter (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.444" end="00:47.614" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That b***h a thot (Uh), that girl a cooter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.614" end="00:49.529">You be rockin' stolen Gucci, boy, you a ****ing looter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.529" end="00:51.702">Man **** that shit, man we makin' racks in the studio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.702" end="00:53.606">This a gangster's paradise, b***h, I feel like I'm Coolio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.606" end="00:55.752">I ain't worried in the club, 'cause I snuck in the toolio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.752" end="00:57.935">Boy, leave me alone, you scarin' the groupies bro</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.935" end="01:00.108">I tell her, "Hit, hit, hit me on my cellular"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.108" end="01:02.000">My wrist Ben 10, it ain't from earth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.000" end="01:04.148">Whole gang on top, we led the herd</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.148" end="01:06.312">And the word around town is you fell, ya heard?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.312" end="01:07.812">[Chorus: 1nonly &amp; Savage Ga$p]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.573" end="01:08.431">Got a bad b***h, so I told her, "What's up?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.431" end="01:10.359">You know who it is when I step in the club</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.359" end="01:12.486">Like, "Oh, shit, b***h, why you tryna ****?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.486" end="01:14.623">Break it down and bring that shit back up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.623" end="01:16.767">Like, "Oh, shit , get out the way"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.767" end="01:18.660">I be makin' moves, b***h, I be makin' plays</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.660" end="01:20.818" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm smooth, b***h, money on the way (Ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.818" end="01:22.968" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't give a **** 'cause I be gettin' pape' (Look, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.968" end="01:24.468">Like—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.489" end="01:24.989">[Verse 2: Savage Ga$p]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.025" end="01:25.525" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like, move b***h, get out the way (Ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.096" end="01:27.229" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hello Kitty crop-top, Off-White jays (Ayy, ayy, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.229" end="01:29.131">And I got rich all off the hits in my closet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.131" end="01:31.258" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just make songs for the girls and the gays (Rrrah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.258" end="01:33.428" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">E-girls love me (Ayy), moms wanna **** me (Ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.428" end="01:35.598" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Your girlfriend playlists me and me only (Yuh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.598" end="01:37.469" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">At this point, my feature price is priceless (Okay, okay, okay, okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.469" end="01:39.615" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">My wrist is icy, my opps is corny (Ayy-ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.615" end="01:41.741">'Cause I'm gold and platinum, don't even at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.741" end="01:43.645">I'm everlasting, you never last</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.645" end="01:46.049">And I hit her text and said, "Do you want me?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.049" end="01:47.941" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause I still got love for you, mamí (Hahaha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.941" end="01:49.441">[Chorus: 1nonly]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.469" end="01:52.251">Bad b***h, so I told her, "What's up?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.251" end="01:54.430">You know who it is when I step in the club</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.430" end="01:56.294">Like, "Oh, shit, b***h, why you tryna ****?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.294" end="01:58.470">Break it down and bring that shit back up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.470" end="02:00.350">Like, "Oh, shit, get out the way"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.350" end="02:02.533">I be makin' moves, b***h, I be makin' plays</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.533" end="02:04.670">I'm smooth, b***h, money on the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.670" end="02:06.817">I don't give a **** 'cause I be gettin' pape'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.817" end="02:10.817">Like, oh—</p></div></body></tt>